  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/kotlin-for-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/FORGE  需安裝-1e2a41?labelColor=gray&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/kotlin-for-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/KOTLIN FOR FORGE-blue?logo=kotlin&amp;labelColor=gray&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CREATE-ae7c38?logo=curseforge&amp;labelColor=gray&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-language-kotlin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/FABRIC 需安裝-c6bca5?labelColor=gray&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-language-kotlin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/FABRIC LANGUAGE KOTLIN-blue?logo=kotlin&amp;labelColor=gray&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CREATE FABRIC-ae7c38?logo=curseforge&amp;labelColor=gray&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\"></a></p><p>使用黃銅，你可以將銅背罐升級為噴射背包，\n利用其中的壓縮空氣讓自己在空中推進。</p><p>靈感來自 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simply-jetpacks-2\" rel=\"nofollow\">Simply Jetpacks</a>，\n此噴射背包也具備懸停模式。</p><p>和銅背罐一樣，噴射背包也放置在胸甲欄位，\n可為伸縮臂等物品提供空氣，並可附上<em>容量</em>附魔。\n同樣地，它需要被放置下來並輸入旋轉動力來充能。</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PssbleTrngle/CreateJetpack/1.18.x/screenshots/usage.png\" alt=\"使用方式\"></p><p>在水中衝刺游泳時，噴射背包會提升你的游泳速度。\n此外，懸停模式可防止你在水中下沉。</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PssbleTrngle/CreateJetpack/1.18.x/screenshots/underwater.png\" alt=\"水中使用\"></p><p>如果安裝了類似 <a href=\"https://github.com/illusivesoulworks/elytraslot\" rel=\"nofollow\">Elytra Slot</a> 的模組（可在胸甲之外額外裝備鞘翅），\n當玩家按下<code>上</code>鍵時，噴射背包將改為提供類似煙火的助推效果。</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PssbleTrngle/CreateJetpack/1.18.x/screenshots/elytra.png\" alt=\"鞘翅支援\"></p>",
